---
title: "place (Sui Framework: kiosk_extension)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_installed: assert is_installed(self)
    q_check_installed --> q_abort_installed: not installed
    q_abort_installed --> [*]: abort EExtensionNotInstalled
    q_check_installed --> q_check_perm: installed
    q_check_perm --> q_abort_perm: !can_place AND !can_lock
    q_abort_perm --> [*]: abort EExtensionNotAllowed
    q_check_perm --> q_place: has place or lock permission
    q_place --> [*]: self.place_internal(item)

    note right of q_check_perm
        INV-001: extension must be installed AND enabled
        INV-002: requires PLACE or LOCK permission bit
        INV-003: requires TransferPolicy to exist for type T
        INV-004: uses internal place (bypasses owner check)
    end note
